HEARTBEAT Track 2 Training Baselines

This distribution includes the supplied Venus training implementation built on
LLaMA-Factory. Original source-file copyright and license notices are retained.
The bundled LICENSE is Apache License 2.0. Model weights and datasets are not
included and are governed by their respective licenses.

LLaMA-Factory: https://github.com/hiyouga/LLaMA-Factory

HEARTBEAT additions (2026): public Parquet conversion, task-specific training
recipes, launch/cache isolation and documentation.
Evaluation additions (2026): native Audio/Video stream replay, prediction logs,
time-blind optional content judging, event matching and comparison tools.

The following training files include HEARTBEAT compatibility changes:
  Track 2/src/llamafactory/data/minicpmo.py
  Track 2/src/llamafactory/model/adapter.py
  Track 2/src/llamafactory/model/model_utils/minicpmo.py
  Track 2/src/llamafactory/model/model_utils/visual.py
  Track 2/src/llamafactory/model/patcher.py
  Track 2/src/llamafactory/train/sft/trainer.py
  Track 2/src/llamafactory/train/sft/workflow.py

Changes enable the released Venus model type, fail-fast data handling and
BF16-compatible chunked loss.

The event matcher, response parser, task scoring rules and judge prompt include
code adapted from OmniPro.
https://github.com/RuixiangZhao/OmniPro

